        "pitch": "Okay, picture this: It's 1997. We\u2019ve got bright neon colors, infectious J-pop, and a corgi named Pip who just wants to chase squirrels. But one day, after tripping over an ancient, barnacle-covered music box, Pip discovers he can transform into a tiny, incredibly enthusiastic pirate captain! He's got a miniature pirate ship, a crew of equally quirky animal companions \u2013 a sarcastic parrot, a perpetually anxious hamster, and a surprisingly competent ferret \u2013 and a series of increasingly ridiculous missions. The animation style will be heavily inspired by 90s anime like *Sailor Moon* and *Rurouni Kenshin*, full of dynamic action sequences mixed with moments of heartwarming friendship. The soundtrack will be a banger, think energetic chiptune and J-pop infused with a nautical twist. Our initial arc involves retrieving a legendary tennis ball, said to grant eternal fetch, from a greedy, rival pirate \u2013 a grumpy bulldog with a penchant for theatrical monologues. \u2018Shiver & Snout\u2019 is a high-energy, visually striking comedy that\u2019s guaranteed to bring the nostalgia and the wags!",
